            <note corresp="#d15-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d15-f1-content">
                <p>Source: National Archives, Nixon Presidential Materials, NSC Files, Kissinger
                    Office Files, Box 53, Country Files, Europe, Monetary Crisis, March 1973.
                    Confidential. Brandt’s message was conveyed to President Nixon under cover of a
                    March 2 letter from West German Ambassador Rolf Pauls. (Ibid., Box 62, Country
